[{"id":12,"slug":"solana-summer","title":"Solana Summer Camp","label":"Hackathon blockchain","description":"Solana est une blockchain reconnue pour sa rapidité et son efficacité. Son hackathon annuel Summer Camp a réuni 18 000 participants et 750 projets.","heroImage":"/images/case-studies/SolanaSummer-1.png","visionTitle":"The Vision","visionText":"Together with the Solana Foundation we aimed to create a vibrant and engaging visual identity for the Solana Summer Camp Hackathon. This online global event, aimed at developers and builders, featured up to $5 million in prizes and seed funding. Our goal was to capture the essence of a fun and wacky, yet innovative summer camp vibe while appealing to a tech-savvy audience.","visionSubtext":"From logo design to branding, to custom nerdy illustrations, to website and animation—this project was definitely one of our favorites.","fullImage":"/images/case-studies/solana-2.png","challengeTitle":"The Challenge","challengeText":"For the website itself, we designed a vibrant foundation of styles to build upon. Featuring eye-candy colors, modern typography, and silly, tech-themed illustrations to inspire developers.","challengeImage":"/images/case-studies/solana-3.png","solutionTitle":"The Solution","solutionText":"To expand on the brand, we created unique name tags per each city, event badges with caricatures, and quirky illustrations. Colorful icons representing different categories, all contributing to a cohesive and energetic visual identity that engages and inspires participants.","solutionImage":"/images/case-studies/solana-4.png","stats":[{"val":"18,000","label":"Participants"},{"val":"750","label":"Projects Submitted"},{"val":"$5M+","label":"Prize Pool"}],"duration":"3 months","role":"Brand, Illustration, Web, Animation","industry":"Blockchain / Technology","timeline":null,"displayOrder":1,"featured":true,"videoUrl":"/images/videos/solana-summer.mp4","editorialImages":["/images/case-studies/SolanaSummer-1.png","/images/case-studies/SolanaSummer-2.png","/images/case-studies/SolanaSummer-3.png","/images/case-studies/SolanaSummer-4.png","/images/case-studies/SolanaSummer-5.png","/images/case-studies/SolanaSummer-6.png","/images/case-studies/SolanaSummer-7.png"],"editorialSections":[{"type":"text","label":"Overview","content":"Together with the Solana Foundation, we created a vibrant and engaging visual identity for the Solana Summer Camp Hackathon. This online global event featured up to $5 million in prizes and seed funding, attracting 18,000 participants who submitted 750 projects.","heading":"Summer of Innovation","subtext":"From logo design to branding, custom illustrations, website, and animation—this project was one of our favorites."},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[1,2]},{"type":"quote","quote":"Capturing the essence of a fun and wacky, yet innovative summer camp vibe while appealing to a tech-savvy audience of builders and developers.","attribution":"Creative Direction"},{"type":"image-text","content":"For the website, we designed a vibrant foundation of styles to build upon—eye-candy colors, modern typography, and silly tech-themed illustrations to inspire developers. Every visual element was crafted to spark creativity and encourage participation.","heading":"Visual Foundation","imageIndex":3},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":4},{"type":"text-image","content":"We created unique name tags per city, event badges with caricatures, and quirky illustrations. Colorful icons representing different categories all contributed to a cohesive and energetic visual identity that engages and inspires participants across the globe.","heading":"Brand Extensions","imageIndex":5},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":6},{"type":"text","label":"Impact","content":"Every city where the event was held had its own custom badge design. No stone was left unturned. The brand seamlessly extended into animations, swag, and event materials—proving that a well-executed identity can energize an entire community of builders.","heading":"Global Reach","subtext":"18,000 participants, 750 projects, and $5M+ in prizes across a global hackathon."}],"draft":false,"heroFeatured":false,"heroOrder":0,"searchTags":null},{"id":9,"slug":"rumble","title":"Rumble","label":"Identité et plateforme","description":"Une refonte complète de la marque et de la plateforme dédiée aux créateurs : logo, site web, application mobile, application TV et supports marketing.","heroImage":"/images/case-studies/rumble-hero.png","visionTitle":"A Complete Rebrand","visionText":"We built Rumble's brand from the ground up — logo, identity system, color palette, typography, and brand guidelines. Every element was designed to communicate boldness, independence, and a platform that champions free expression.","visionSubtext":"Logo design, brand identity, guidelines, and a visual language that scales across every touchpoint.","fullImage":"/images/case-studies/rumble-hero.png","challengeTitle":"End-to-End Design","challengeText":"Rumble came to us for everything. We designed and delivered the complete brand identity, the website, the mobile app, the TV app, and all marketing collateral. From the logomark to the last pixel on the big screen — every surface is Unfold.","challengeImage":"/images/case-studies/rumble-3.png","solutionTitle":"Website & Digital","solutionText":"The Rumble website was redesigned to reflect the new brand identity — bold, fast, and conversion-focused. We crafted every page from the homepage to creator onboarding, ensuring the digital experience matched the ambition of the platform.","solutionImage":"/images/case-studies/rumble-brand-guidelines.png","stats":[{"val":"10M+","label":"Creator Accounts"},{"val":"3x","label":"Engagement Increase"},{"val":"$500M","label":"Creator Payouts"}],"duration":"12 Months","role":"Brand, Web, Mobile, TV & Collateral","industry":"Creator Economy","timeline":"Q2 2022 — Q4 2023","displayOrder":2,"featured":true,"videoUrl":null,"editorialImages":["/images/case-studies/rumble-brand-guidelines.png","/images/case-studies/rumble-hero.png","/images/case-studies/rumble-3.png","/images/case-studies/rumble-10.png","/images/case-studies/rumble-11.png","/images/case-studies/rumble-6.png","/images/case-studies/rumble-7.png","/images/case-studies/rumble-8.png","/images/case-studies/rumble-9.png","/images/case-studies/rumble-5.png","/images/case-studies/rumble-12.png"],"editorialSections":[{"type":"text","label":"Branding","content":"We built Rumble's brand from the ground up — logo, identity system, color palette, typography, and brand guidelines. Every element was designed to communicate boldness, independence, and a platform that champions free expression.","heading":"A Complete Rebrand","subtext":"Logo design, brand identity, guidelines, and a visual language that scales across every touchpoint."},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":0},{"type":"text","label":"Overview","content":"Rumble came to us for everything. We designed and delivered the complete brand identity, the website, the mobile app, the TV app, and all marketing collateral. From the logomark to the last pixel on the big screen — every surface is Unfold.","heading":"End-to-End Design","subtext":"Brand, web, mobile, TV, and marketing — a unified design system across every platform."},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[1,2]},{"type":"quote","quote":"We didn't just design a logo. We built an entire world around it — across web, mobile, TV, and everything in between.","attribution":"Design Philosophy"},{"type":"image-text","content":"The Rumble website was redesigned to reflect the new brand identity — bold, fast, and conversion-focused. We crafted every page from the homepage to creator onboarding, ensuring the digital experience matched the ambition of the platform.","heading":"Website & Digital","imageIndex":3},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":4},{"type":"text-image","content":"We designed the native mobile app and the TV app experience from scratch. The mobile app brings the full power of the platform into your hand, while the TV app delivers a lean-back viewing experience that feels premium and effortless.","heading":"Mobile & TV Apps","imageIndex":5},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[6,7]},{"type":"text","label":"Collateral","content":"Beyond digital, we produced the full suite of marketing collateral — social templates, advertising assets, event materials, and presentation decks. Every piece reinforces the brand system, ensuring Rumble looks and feels consistent everywhere it shows up.","heading":"Marketing & Print"},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":8},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":9},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":10},{"type":"text","label":"Result","content":"Rumble now has a cohesive identity that spans every platform and touchpoint. With over 10 million creator accounts and 3x engagement increases, the rebrand helped Rumble establish itself as a serious contender in the creator economy — recognized, trusted, and unmistakable.","heading":"One Brand, Every Screen"}],"draft":false,"heroFeatured":false,"heroOrder":0,"searchTags":null},{"id":6,"slug":"xrp","title":"Ripple Markets","label":"Architecture fintech","description":"Repenser les flux de liquidité pour un avenir décentralisé, avec une précision absolue.","heroImage":"/images/case-studies/xrp-2.png","visionTitle":"The Vision","visionText":"As Ripple expands its footprint in global institutional finance, the need for a high-fidelity, high-precision liquidity dashboard became paramount. Unfold was commissioned to design Ripple Markets—a professional-grade interface that bridges the gap between traditional banking infrastructure and the speed of decentralized ledger technology.","visionSubtext":"The challenge was to maintain institutional gravity while introducing the fluidity of real-time blockchain settlement.","fullImage":"/images/case-studies/xrp-2.png","challengeTitle":"Complexity vs. Clarity","challengeText":"Financial interfaces often suffer from data density. We needed to display thousands of real-time data points without overwhelming the user. Our solution involved a modular grid system that prioritizes information based on user intent.","challengeImage":"/images/case-studies/xrp-4.png","solutionTitle":"Atomic Precision","solutionText":"We broke down every component to its atomic state. Buttons, inputs, and charts were redesigned to share a common mathematical language. This ensured that no matter how the dashboard was configured, it always felt cohesive.","solutionImage":"/images/case-studies/xrp-7.png","stats":[{"val":"1B+","label":"XRP Mark Impressions"},{"val":"Top 3","label":"Crypto Currency"},{"val":"Muiltiple","label":"Sub brands"}],"duration":"6 Months","role":"XRP mark branding, Product Strategy & Design","industry":"Blockchain & Finance","timeline":"Q3 2021 — Q1 2022","displayOrder":3,"featured":true,"videoUrl":null,"editorialImages":["/images/case-studies/xrp.png","/images/case-studies/xrp-2.png","/images/case-studies/xrp-4.png","/images/case-studies/xrp-7.png","/images/case-studies/xrp-8.png","/images/case-studies/xrp-9.png","/images/case-studies/xrp-10.png","/images/case-studies/xrp-11.png","/images/case-studies/xrp-13.png","/images/case-studies/xrp-14.png","/images/case-studies/xrp-15.png"],"editorialSections":[{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":0},{"type":"text","label":"Overview","content":"As Ripple expands its footprint in global institutional finance, the need for a high-fidelity, high-precision liquidity dashboard became paramount. We designed a professional-grade interface that bridges traditional banking and decentralized ledger technology.","heading":"Precision Finance","subtext":"Maintaining institutional gravity while introducing the fluidity of real-time blockchain settlement."},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[1,2]},{"type":"quote","quote":"Financial interfaces should feel like precision instruments—every element calibrated, every interaction intentional.","attribution":"Design Principle"},{"type":"image-text","content":"Financial interfaces suffer from data density. We needed to display thousands of real-time data points without overwhelming the user. Our modular grid system prioritizes information based on user intent and market conditions.","heading":"Data Architecture","imageIndex":3},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":4},{"type":"text-image","content":"We broke every component to its atomic state. Buttons, inputs, and charts share a common mathematical language. No matter how the dashboard is configured, it always feels cohesive and purposeful.","heading":"Component System","imageIndex":5},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[6,7]},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":8},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":9},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":10},{"type":"text","label":"Outcome","content":"The result is a trading interface that institutional players trust with billions in daily volume. Speed, clarity, and precision—the three pillars that guide every design decision in the Ripple Markets ecosystem.","heading":"Institutional Grade"}],"draft":false,"heroFeatured":false,"heroOrder":0,"searchTags":null},{"id":25,"slug":"brainfm","title":"Brain.fm","label":"IA et neurosciences","description":"Concevoir la marque et l’expérience produit d’une musique fonctionnelle générée par IA, à la rencontre des neurosciences et du design sonore.","heroImage":"/images/case-studies/brainfm-1.png","visionTitle":"The Vision","visionText":"Brain.fm creates AI-generated music scientifically designed to enhance focus, relaxation, and sleep. We were brought on to craft a brand identity and product experience that bridges the gap between rigorous neuroscience and an effortlessly beautiful user experience.","visionSubtext":"The challenge was to make complex neural modulation technology feel as simple and inviting as pressing play.","fullImage":"/images/case-studies/brainfm-2.png","challengeTitle":"Science Without Sterility","challengeText":"Functional music lives at the intersection of neuroscience and consumer wellness. The brand needed to communicate scientific credibility without feeling clinical. Every design choice had to earn trust through clarity — not complexity.","challengeImage":"/images/case-studies/brainfm-3.png","solutionTitle":"Designed for Deep Work","solutionText":"We created a visual system inspired by waveforms, neural patterns, and gradient fields. The product interface strips away everything unnecessary — one tap to focus. The UI recedes as the music takes over, respecting the user's attention as much as the product claims to protect it.","solutionImage":"/images/case-studies/brainfm-5.png","stats":[{"val":"2M+","label":"Active Users"},{"val":"500K+","label":"Hours Focused Daily"},{"val":"40+","label":"Published Studies"}],"duration":"12+ Months","role":"Brand Identity, Product, Web and Emails","industry":"AI & Wellness Tech","timeline":"Q2 2022 — Ongoing","displayOrder":4,"featured":true,"videoUrl":"/images/videos/brainfm-intro.mp4","editorialImages":["/images/case-studies/brainfm-1.png","/images/case-studies/brainfm-2.png","/images/case-studies/brainfm-3.png","/images/case-studies/brainfm-4.png","/images/case-studies/brainfm-5.png","/images/case-studies/brainfm-6.png","/images/case-studies/brainfm-7.png","/images/case-studies/brainfm-8.png","/images/case-studies/brainfm-9.png","/images/case-studies/brainfm-10.png","/images/case-studies/brainfm-11.png"],"editorialSections":[{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":1},{"type":"text","label":"Overview","content":"Brain.fm uses AI-generated functional music to enhance focus, relaxation, and sleep. We designed a brand identity and product experience that communicates the science behind the sound—without losing the magic that makes it feel effortless.","heading":"Sound Science","subtext":"The intersection of neuroscience and design. Every visual decision is backed by the same rigor as the audio technology."},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[0,9]},{"type":"video-full","videoUrl":"/images/videos/brainfm01.mp4"},{"type":"quote","quote":"Music is the invisible architecture of the mind. The brand needed to feel just as intentional — precise, immersive, and quietly transformative.","attribution":"Creative Direction"},{"type":"image-text","content":"We developed a visual system rooted in waveforms, neural patterns, and gradient fields that mirror the audio experience. The palette shifts between deep focus blues and warm relaxation tones — each state has its own visual signature.","heading":"Visual Language","imageIndex":2},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":10},{"type":"text-image","content":"The app interface strips away everything unnecessary. One tap to focus. The UI recedes as the music takes over — a deliberate design choice that respects the user's attention as much as the product claims to protect it.","heading":"Product Experience","imageIndex":5},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[8,7]},{"type":"video-full","videoUrl":"/images/videos/brainfm.mp4"},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":6},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":4},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":3},{"type":"text","label":"Result","content":"The rebrand positioned Brain.fm as the definitive tool for cognitive performance. A visual identity as focused as the product itself — no noise, no decoration, just design that works as hard as the music does.","heading":"Designed for Deep Work"}],"draft":false,"heroFeatured":false,"heroOrder":0,"searchTags":null},{"id":7,"slug":"lamar","title":"Lamar Advertising","label":"Affichage extérieur","description":"Moderniser le leader américain de l’affichage extérieur, à la rencontre de la transformation numérique et de la présence physique.","heroImage":"/images/case-studies/lamar-2.png","visionTitle":"The Vision","visionText":"Lamar Advertising dominates the physical landscape with over 350,000 displays nationwide. We were tasked with bringing that same commanding presence into the digital realm—creating a platform that transforms how advertisers plan, purchase, and measure outdoor campaigns.","visionSubtext":"Bridging the gap between the physical billboard and the digital dashboard.","fullImage":"/images/case-studies/lamar-2.png","challengeTitle":"Analog to Digital","challengeText":"The outdoor advertising industry operates on relationships and intuition. We needed to digitize decades of institutional knowledge without losing the human element. The platform had to feel as authoritative as the billboards themselves.","challengeImage":"/images/case-studies/lamar-3.png","solutionTitle":"Command & Control","solutionText":"We designed a campaign management system that gives media buyers god-view over their outdoor presence. Real-time inventory, dynamic pricing, and audience analytics—all rendered with the visual weight of the billboards they represent.","solutionImage":"/images/case-studies/lamar-4.png","stats":[{"val":"350K+","label":"Display Locations"},{"val":"2.3x","label":"Engagement increase"},{"val":"65%","label":"Digital Adoption"}],"duration":"10 Months","role":"Platform Design & Analytics","industry":"Advertising & Media","timeline":"Q2 2022 — Q2 2023","displayOrder":5,"featured":true,"videoUrl":null,"editorialImages":["/images/case-studies/lamar-2.png","/images/case-studies/lamar-3.png","/images/case-studies/lamar-4.png","/images/case-studies/lamar-5.png","/images/case-studies/lamar-6.png","/images/case-studies/lamar-7.png","/images/case-studies/lamar-8.png","/images/case-studies/lamar-9.png","/images/case-studies/lamar-10.png"],"editorialSections":[{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":0},{"type":"text","label":"Overview","content":"Lamar Advertising dominates the physical landscape with over 350,000 displays nationwide. We brought that commanding presence into the digital realm—creating a platform that transforms how advertisers plan, purchase, and measure outdoor campaigns.","heading":"Digital Meets Physical","subtext":"Bridging the gap between the physical billboard and the digital dashboard."},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[8,6]},{"type":"quote","quote":"The outdoor advertising industry has been doing business on handshakes for decades. We digitized the handshake without losing the human touch.","attribution":"Project Lead"},{"type":"image-text","content":"We designed a campaign management system that gives media buyers god-view over their outdoor presence. Real-time inventory, dynamic pricing, and audience analytics—rendered with the visual weight of the billboards they represent.","heading":"Campaign Intelligence","imageIndex":1},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":3},{"type":"text-image","content":"Every billboard, poster, and digital display is mapped and visualized. Buyers can explore inventory geographically, filter by demographics, and build campaigns with the precision of programmatic digital—applied to the physical world.","heading":"Inventory Visualization","imageIndex":4},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[5,7]},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":2},{"type":"text","label":"Impact","content":"The platform accelerated Lamar's digital transformation, driving a 65% increase in digital inventory adoption. By making outdoor advertising as accessible as digital, we opened the medium to a new generation of advertisers.","heading":"Analog to Digital"}],"draft":false,"heroFeatured":false,"heroOrder":0,"searchTags":null},{"id":8,"slug":"peacock","title":"Peacock Streaming","label":"Plateforme de divertissement","description":"Concevoir l’expérience de streaming de la plateforme phare de NBCUniversal, là où le contenu rencontre le savoir-faire.","heroImage":"/images/case-studies/peacock-2.png","visionTitle":"The Vision","visionText":"Peacock needed to stand apart in an increasingly crowded streaming landscape. We designed an experience that puts content discovery first, using editorial curation and intelligent recommendations to surface the right story at the right moment.","visionSubtext":"In a world of infinite content, the interface becomes the editor.","fullImage":"/images/case-studies/peacock-2.png","challengeTitle":"Discovery vs. Overwhelm","challengeText":"With thousands of titles across live sports, news, and entertainment, the content catalog can overwhelm. We created a discovery engine that feels like browsing a curated magazine—each scroll revealing a new editorial moment.","challengeImage":"/images/case-studies/peacock-4.png","solutionTitle":"Cinematic Interface","solutionText":"We treated every screen as a frame. The UI itself became cinematic—using full-bleed imagery, typographic hierarchy, and purposeful negative space to let content breathe. The result is a streaming platform that feels like watching, even while browsing.","solutionImage":"/images/case-studies/peacock-5.png","stats":[{"val":"12%","label":"Subscribers Growth"},{"val":"4.5 ★","label":"App Store Rating"},{"val":"55%","label":"Content Discovery Rate"}],"duration":"2 Months","role":"Product Design & UX Strategy, Brand Expansion","industry":"Entertainment & Streaming","timeline":"Q4 2021 — Q2 2022","displayOrder":6,"featured":true,"videoUrl":null,"editorialImages":["/images/case-studies/peacock-2.png","/images/case-studies/peacock-4.png","/images/case-studies/peacock-5.png","/images/case-studies/peacock-6.png","/images/case-studies/peacock-7.png","/images/case-studies/peacock-9.png","/images/case-studies/peacock-10.png"],"editorialSections":[{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":0},{"type":"text","label":"Overview","content":"Peacock needed to stand apart in an increasingly crowded streaming landscape. We designed an experience that puts content discovery first, using editorial curation and intelligent recommendations to surface the right story at the right moment.","heading":"Content as Interface","subtext":"In a world of infinite content, the interface becomes the editor."},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[1,2]},{"type":"quote","quote":"Streaming platforms show you everything. We designed one that shows you exactly what you need.","attribution":"Creative Direction"},{"type":"image-text","content":"We treated every screen as a frame. The UI became cinematic—using full-bleed imagery, typographic hierarchy, and purposeful negative space to let content breathe. Browsing should feel like watching.","heading":"Cinematic UI","imageIndex":3},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":4},{"type":"text-image","content":"With thousands of titles across live sports, news, and entertainment, the catalog can overwhelm. We created a discovery system that feels like browsing a curated magazine—each scroll revealing a new editorial moment.","heading":"Discovery Engine","imageIndex":5},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":6}],"draft":false,"heroFeatured":false,"heroOrder":0,"searchTags":null},{"id":5,"slug":"facebook","title":"Facebook (Libra)","label":"Blockchain et monnaie numérique","description":"Concevoir l’identité visuelle et l’expérience produit de l’ambitieux projet mondial de cryptomonnaie de Facebook, une monnaie stable pensée pour rendre les services financiers plus accessibles.","heroImage":"/images/case-studies/fb-8.png","visionTitle":"The Vision","visionText":"Libra was Facebook's bold attempt to create a permissioned blockchain-based stablecoin — a simple, low-fee global digital currency accessible to 2.4 billion users via smartphones. Unfold was brought on to craft the product experience and visual language for a project that aimed to provide financial services to 1.7 billion unbanked people worldwide.","visionSubtext":"The challenge was to make decentralized finance feel trustworthy, intuitive, and universally accessible — even to those who had never held a bank account.","fullImage":"/images/case-studies/fb-2.png","challengeTitle":"Trust at Scale","challengeText":"Building a financial product under the Facebook umbrella meant confronting deep public skepticism around data privacy. Every design decision had to communicate transparency and security. We created a visual system that separated Libra's identity from Facebook while leveraging the reach of Messenger and WhatsApp as distribution channels.","challengeImage":"/images/case-studies/fb-3.png","solutionTitle":"Universal Financial Language","solutionText":"We developed a design system that could operate across cultures, literacy levels, and device capabilities. The interface distilled complex blockchain mechanics — wallets, reserves, cross-border transfers — into interactions as simple as sending a message. The Move programming language and LibraBFT consensus protocol were abstracted behind a calm, confident visual layer.","solutionImage":"/images/case-studies/fb-4.png","stats":[{"val":"28","label":"Founding Members"},{"val":"1.7B","label":"Unbanked Target Users"},{"val":"1000+","label":"Transactions Per Second"}],"duration":"3 Months","role":"Libra brand expansion, App design, Iconography ","industry":"Blockchain & Fintech","timeline":"Q1 2019 — Q2 2019","displayOrder":7,"featured":true,"videoUrl":null,"editorialImages":["/images/case-studies/fb-2.png","/images/case-studies/fb-3.png","/images/case-studies/fb-3-1.png","/images/case-studies/fb-4.png","/images/case-studies/fb-6.png","/images/case-studies/fb-7.png","/images/case-studies/fb-8.png","/images/case-studies/fb-9.png"],"editorialSections":[{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":0},{"type":"text","label":"Overview","content":"Facebook needed a design evolution that could serve billions while feeling personal. We reimagined core interaction patterns to create moments of genuine connection within an ecosystem of unprecedented scale.","heading":"Redesigning Connection","subtext":"The challenge was to make something used by three billion people feel intimate and intentional."},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[1,2]},{"type":"quote","quote":"The interface should disappear. What remains is the human connection it enables.","attribution":"Design Philosophy"},{"type":"image-text","content":"We developed a component system that flexes across cultures, languages, and contexts. Every element shares a mathematical relationship with its neighbors—creating visual harmony that scales from mobile to desktop, from São Paulo to Seoul.","heading":"Platform Architecture","imageIndex":3},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":4},{"type":"text-image","content":"Every tap, swipe, and scroll was choreographed. We designed micro-interactions that provide feedback without friction—subtle animations that confirm intent and build confidence in the interface.","heading":"Interaction Design","imageIndex":5},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[6,7]},{"type":"text","label":"Reflection","content":"When your design decisions affect three billion people, restraint becomes your greatest tool. We learned that the most powerful interfaces are the ones that feel invisible—guiding without demanding, connecting without intruding.","heading":"Designing at Scale","subtext":"This project redefined our understanding of what design at scale truly means."}],"draft":false,"heroFeatured":false,"heroOrder":0,"searchTags":null},{"id":11,"slug":"safepal","title":"SafePal","label":"Portefeuille crypto","description":"Un stockage simple et sécurisé des actifs numériques, pensé pour le mobile. Une refonte complète qui a fait passer SafePal du concept à une référence du Web3.","heroImage":"/images/case-studies/safepal-hero.png","visionTitle":"The Vision","visionText":"We took SafePal from \"meh\" to \"wow\" with a brand new logo that's sharper than a ninja star, a brand system that ties everything together like a superhero's cape, and isometric illustrations that make your eyes do a happy dance.","visionSubtext":"We didn't stop there; we dove into packaging, crafting designs that make you want to keep the box forever. And the product design—sleek, intuitive, and refined.","fullImage":"/images/case-studies/safepal-2.png","challengeTitle":"The Challenge","challengeText":"SafePal needed to stand out in the crowded crypto wallet space. The existing brand lacked the sophistication and trust signals needed to compete at the highest level. Custom icons, intuitive UI, and a seamless UX were essential to make Web3 feel like second nature.","challengeImage":"/images/case-studies/safepal-3.png","solutionTitle":"The Solution","solutionText":"Now SafePal isn't just keeping up with the crypto crowd—it's leading the pack with a fresh, fearless look that screams innovation. We've taken them from zero to Web3 hero in record time with product design, messaging, branding, web, and illustration.","solutionImage":"/images/case-studies/safepal-4.png","stats":[{"val":"10M+","label":"App Downloads"},{"val":"54+","label":"Supported Chains"},{"val":"100m+","label":"Impressions"}],"duration":"6 months","role":"Brand, Product, Illustration, Web, Packaging","industry":"Cryptocurrency / Web3","timeline":null,"displayOrder":8,"featured":true,"videoUrl":null,"editorialImages":["/images/case-studies/safepal-1.png","/images/case-studies/safepal-2.png","/images/case-studies/safepal-3.png","/images/case-studies/safepal-4.png","/images/case-studies/safepal-5.png","/images/case-studies/safepal-6.png","/images/case-studies/safepal-7.png","/images/case-studies/safepal-8.png","/images/case-studies/safepal-9.png"],"editorialSections":[{"type":"text","label":"Overview","content":"We took SafePal from concept to category leader with a brand new logo, a comprehensive brand system, and isometric illustrations that bring the crypto experience to life. We didn't stop there—we dove into packaging, crafting designs that make you want to keep the box forever.","heading":"From Zero to Web3 Hero","subtext":"Product design, messaging, branding, web, and illustration—all unified under one cohesive vision."},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[1]},{"type":"quote","quote":"SafePal isn't just keeping up with the crypto crowd—it's leading the pack with a fresh, fearless look that screams innovation.","attribution":"Brand Strategy"},{"type":"image-text","content":"The new identity needed to communicate trust and security while remaining approachable for mainstream crypto users. We developed a visual language that bridges the gap between institutional finance and the Web3 frontier—sharp, modern, and unmistakably SafePal.","heading":"Brand Architecture","imageIndex":2},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":4},{"type":"text-image","content":"Custom icons are candy for the eyes. The user interface is intuitive enough for anyone to use with ease. The user experience was designed to make Web3 feel like second nature—sleek, seamless, and making crypto management effortless.","heading":"Design produit","imageIndex":8},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[6,7]},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":5},{"type":"text","label":"Result","content":"Now SafePal leads the crypto wallet space with a fresh, fearless identity. From packaging to product design, every touchpoint communicates the same message: crypto doesn't have to be complicated. We took them from zero to Web3 hero in record time.","heading":"Leading the Pack","subtext":"Over 10 million downloads and 54+ supported blockchain networks."},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":3}],"draft":false,"heroFeatured":false,"heroOrder":0,"searchTags":null},{"id":13,"slug":"wonder-dynamics","title":"Wonder Dynamics","label":"AI-Powered VFX","description":"Recently acquired. An AI tool that automatically animates, lights, and composes CG characters into a live-action scene. We revitalized their brand and built their product.","heroImage":"/images/case-studies/wonder-1.png","visionTitle":"The Vision","visionText":"We recently revitalized Wonder Dynamics' brand identity, giving it a sleek, modern look and a dynamic website with vibrant, glowy visuals. Additionally, we developed a user-friendly web and mobile app that allows you to replace any character in footage with a 3D model—all within your browser.","visionSubtext":"To make the brand more human and welcoming, we began by defining the logo as the face of the brand—the friendly robot in WONDER. From there, we explored colors, fonts, and elements to complete this new identity.","fullImage":"/images/case-studies/wonder-2.png","challengeTitle":"The Challenge","challengeText":"The new website needed to be a visual effects extravaganza, with dynamic visuals and an intuitive experience that makes it a breeze for clients to explore their AI-driven VFX solutions. With a fresh color palette and a user experience smoother than 100fps.","challengeImage":"/images/case-studies/wonder-3.png","solutionTitle":"The Solution","solutionText":"We designed Wonder Dynamics' app to provide users with a seamless experience, allowing them to easily and quickly upload videos and replace characters with their 3D models. The result is a product that feels as magical as the technology it powers.","solutionImage":"/images/case-studies/wonder-4.png","stats":[{"val":"Autodesk","label":"Acquisition"},{"val":"AI/VFX","label":"Category"},{"val":"500k","label":"Users"}],"duration":"8 months","role":"Brand, Product, Web, Illustration","industry":"AI / Visual Effects","timeline":null,"displayOrder":9,"featured":false,"videoUrl":null,"editorialImages":["/images/case-studies/wonder-1.png","/images/case-studies/wonder-2.png","/images/case-studies/wonder-3.png","/images/case-studies/wonder-4.png","/images/case-studies/wonder-5.png","/images/case-studies/wonder-6.png","/images/case-studies/wonder-7.png","/images/case-studies/wonder-8.png","/images/case-studies/wonder-9.png"],"editorialSections":[{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":0},{"type":"text","label":"Overview","content":"We revitalized Wonder Dynamics' brand identity, giving it a sleek, modern look and a dynamic website with vibrant, glowy visuals. We developed a user-friendly web and mobile app that allows you to replace any character in footage with a 3D model—all within your browser.","heading":"AI Meets Cinema","subtext":"Making the brand more human and welcoming by defining the friendly robot in WONDER as the face of the brand."},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[1,2]},{"type":"quote","quote":"We began by defining the logo as the face of the brand—the friendly robot in WONDER. From there, we explored colors, fonts, and elements to complete this new identity.","attribution":"Brand Philosophy"},{"type":"image-text","content":"The new website is a visual effects extravaganza, with dynamic visuals and an intuitive experience that makes it easy for clients to explore AI-driven VFX solutions. With a fresh color palette and a user experience smoother than 100fps, every interaction feels cinematic.","heading":"Digital Experience","imageIndex":3},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":4},{"type":"text-image","content":"We designed Wonder Dynamics' app to provide a seamless experience, allowing users to easily upload videos and replace characters with 3D models. The interface is as intuitive as the AI technology powering it—drag, drop, and watch the magic happen.","heading":"Design produit","imageIndex":5},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[6,7]},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":8},{"type":"text","label":"Outcome","content":"The comprehensive rebrand and product design helped Wonder Dynamics establish itself as a leader in AI-powered visual effects. The result? An acquisition by Autodesk—validating that great design and cutting-edge technology together create unstoppable products.","heading":"Racheté par Autodesk","subtext":"From startup to acquisition: brand, product, web, and illustration working in perfect harmony."}],"draft":false,"heroFeatured":false,"heroOrder":0,"searchTags":null},{"id":14,"slug":"easya","title":"EasyA","label":"Web3 Education Platform","description":"A complete brand identity and digital experience for the world's leading Web3 education app. Brand, website, illustrations, and mobile web—all designed to make blockchain accessible.","heroImage":"/images/case-studies/easya-2.png","visionTitle":"The Vision","visionText":"EasyA is redefining how developers enter the world of Web3—starting with the phone in their pocket. As their design partner, we captured that bold mission in a brand system that feels futuristic, friendly, and undeniably native to the next generation of builders. From brand identity to homepage to internal pages and a full custom illustration system.","visionSubtext":"We created a full visual identity including a modular logo system, vibrant high-contrast color palette, custom typographic language, and heroic layered illustrations evoking a sci-fi metaverse—but always human-centric.","fullImage":"/images/case-studies/easya-2.png","challengeTitle":"The Challenge","challengeText":"EasyA needed an instant-clarity homepage that explains what they do in five seconds—without feeling corporate. The design had to balance storytelling, conversion, and community while maintaining cinematic energy across desktop and mobile. From about pages to live event listings, every screen needed to feel on-brand and performance-optimized.","challengeImage":"/images/case-studies/easya-4.png","solutionTitle":"The Solution","solutionText":"We crafted an immersive dark-mode experience with 3D-style illustrations, neon-accented themes, and animated UI cards that echo the gamified learning experience. The custom illustration system—vibrant, punchy, and rounded—was built to flex across marketing, in-app UI, pitch decks, and social content. Every scroll reinforces the same message: EasyA is where your Web3 journey begins.","solutionImage":"/images/case-studies/easya-5.png","stats":[{"val":"1M+","label":"App Downloads"},{"val":"100+","label":"Hackathons Hosted"},{"val":"Web3","label":"Education Leader"}],"duration":"5 months","role":"Brand, Web, Illustration, Mobile UX","industry":"Web3 / Education","timeline":null,"displayOrder":10,"featured":false,"videoUrl":"/images/case-studies/easya-video.mp4","editorialImages":["/images/case-studies/easya-1.png","/images/case-studies/easya-2.png","/images/case-studies/easya-4.png","/images/case-studies/easya-5.png"],"editorialSections":[{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":0},{"type":"text","label":"Overview","content":"EasyA is redefining how developers enter the world of Web3. As their design partner, we built a complete brand system—from identity and typography to homepage, internal pages, and a custom illustration suite. The goal: make blockchain education feel futuristic, friendly, and native to the next generation of builders.","heading":"Learn Web3. Launch Anywhere.","subtext":"A modular logo system, vibrant high-contrast palette, custom typographic language, and heroic illustrations—all designed to spark curiosity and encourage participation."},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":1},{"type":"quote","quote":"EasyA isn't just another crypto app—it's where your Web3 journey begins. Every scroll reinforces that message.","attribution":"Creative Direction"},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":2},{"type":"text","label":"Illustration","content":"We created a custom illustration system with vibrant, punchy color palettes inspired by tech and youth culture. Rounded character designs with confident poses and oversized proportions, minimal backgrounds to keep focus on the action, and subtle layering for visual depth. The artwork flexes across marketing, in-app UI, pitch decks, and social content.","heading":"Bold, Expressive, Modular","subtext":"Shout out to Vic for taking lead on the illustration system—making Web3 and AI more approachable through shareable, fun visuals."},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":3},{"type":"text","label":"Outcome","content":"This rollout helped EasyA build a cohesive, conversion-ready digital universe—turning curiosity into committed learners. From hero section to hackathon listings to mobile-optimized flows, every touchpoint maintains cinematic energy while creating clear, structured UX for new and returning users alike.","heading":"A Digital Universe"}],"draft":false,"heroFeatured":false,"heroOrder":0,"searchTags":null},{"id":15,"slug":"everyone","title":"Everyone","label":"Communication Platform","description":"Brand identity, custom illustrations, and a playful marketing website for a communication tool that eliminates follow-up emails and gets responses 10x faster.","heroImage":"/images/case-studies/everyone-1.png","visionTitle":"The Vision","visionText":"Everyone came to us with a bold vision: help busy teams eliminate the need for follow-up emails by gently nudging recipients to take action—fast. We set out to create a playful yet highly functional brand and web experience that embodied Everyone's core value: get responses 10x faster, effortlessly.","visionSubtext":"From brand identity to custom illustration suite to animated hero via Rive to a fully responsive marketing website—we built Everything for Everyone.","fullImage":"/images/case-studies/everyone-2.png","challengeTitle":"The Challenge","challengeText":"Everyone needed a web presence that communicated speed and approachability to a product-led, fast-moving audience. The brand had to feel bold, accessible, and unapologetically vibrant—with an illustration system quirky enough to stand out but polished enough for enterprise.","challengeImage":"/images/case-studies/everyone-1.png","solutionTitle":"The Solution","solutionText":"We crafted a bold, accessible logo and visual language system with electric blue, highlighter yellow, punchy magenta, and soft lilac. Black and white character illustrations paired with bold color splashes create a fresh, modern aesthetic. The hero features custom Rive animation showing how a single email ripples out to multiple users. Microinteractions reflect the product's efficiency promise—no more chasing people down.","solutionImage":"/images/case-studies/everyone-2.png","stats":[{"val":"10x","label":"Faster Responses"},{"val":"Zero","label":"Follow-ups Needed"},{"val":"Rive","label":"Animated Hero"}],"duration":"4 months","role":"Brand, Illustration, Web, Animation","industry":"SaaS / Communication","timeline":null,"displayOrder":11,"featured":false,"videoUrl":null,"editorialImages":null,"editorialSections":null,"draft":false,"heroFeatured":false,"heroOrder":0,"searchTags":null},{"id":16,"slug":"xotc","title":"XOTC","label":"Plateforme d’échange crypto","description":"Une identité inspirée du cyberpunk, un système d’illustrations et un site marketing pour une plateforme d’échange d’actifs numériques entre particuliers.","heroImage":"/images/case-studies/xotc-1.png","visionTitle":"The Vision","visionText":"XOTC is a safe and innovative peer-to-peer swapping platform designed for seamless digital asset exchanges. They sought our expertise in revamping their brand, redesigning their website, and enhancing the UX of their trading app. The client was inspired by the cyberpunk futuristic style of Blade Runner and Cyberpunk 2077—and we delivered.","visionSubtext":"A dark yet hope-inspiring visual world with bright, vivid colors. From illustration to brand to website to product UX—every element crafted to feel like the future of trading.","fullImage":"/images/case-studies/xotc-2.png","challengeTitle":"The Challenge","challengeText":"XOTC needed a complete visual overhaul—from brand identity to marketing website to product UX. The design had to blend cyberpunk and futuristic aesthetics with nostalgic retro elements, producing a unique and visually striking user experience that resonates with both modern sensibilities and classic style.","challengeImage":"/images/case-studies/xotc-3.png","solutionTitle":"The Solution","solutionText":"We began with conceptualizing illustrations as the foundation that would guide the overall brand direction. We integrated all individual elements into a cohesive marketing website inspired by cyberpunk and futuristic aesthetics. We then enhanced the product swapper UI/UX through several iterations, ensuring a seamless and intuitive interface for an optimal swapping experience.","solutionImage":"/images/case-studies/xotc-4.png","stats":[{"val":"P2P","label":"Swapping Platform"},{"val":"Cyberpunk","label":"Visual Identity"},{"val":"Web3","label":"Crypto Trading"}],"duration":"3 months","role":"Brand, Illustration, Web, Product UX","industry":"Cryptocurrency / Web3","timeline":null,"displayOrder":12,"featured":true,"videoUrl":"/images/case-studies/xotc-video.mov","editorialImages":["/images/case-studies/xotc-1.png","/images/case-studies/xotc-2.png","/images/case-studies/xotc-3.png","/images/case-studies/xotc-4.png","/images/case-studies/xotc-5.png","/images/case-studies/xotc-6.png","/images/case-studies/xotc-7.png","/images/case-studies/xotc-8.png","/images/case-studies/xotc-9.png","/images/case-studies/xotc-10.png","/images/case-studies/xotc-11.png"],"editorialSections":[{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":0},{"type":"text","label":"Overview","content":"XOTC is a peer-to-peer swapping platform designed for seamless digital asset exchanges. They came to us to revamp their brand, redesign their website, and enhance the UX of their trading app. Inspired by the cyberpunk futuristic style of Blade Runner and Cyberpunk 2077, we delivered a dark yet hope-inspiring visual world.","heading":"The Future of Trading","subtext":"From illustration conceptualization to brand identity to marketing website to product UX—a complete transformation."},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[1,2]},{"type":"quote","quote":"The client was inspired by Blade Runner and Cyberpunk. We delivered a dark yet hope-inspiring hero with bright, vivid colors.","attribution":"Illustration Direction"},{"type":"image-text","content":"We began with conceptualizing illustrations as the crucial foundation that would guide the overall brand direction. These initial visuals were foundational—they significantly influenced everything that followed, from typography to color system to the marketing site architecture.","heading":"Brand Identity","imageIndex":3},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":4},{"type":"text-image","content":"We integrated all individual elements into a cohesive marketing website. The design blends cyberpunk and futuristic aesthetics with nostalgic retro elements—producing a unique and visually striking user experience that resonates with both modern sensibilities and classic style.","heading":"Marketing Website","imageIndex":5},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[6,7]},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":8},{"type":"text","label":"Product","content":"We delved into several iterations to enhance their product and primary swapper UI/UX. Exploring various design concepts and user experience improvements to ensure a seamless and intuitive interface—creating a visually appealing and highly functional platform for optimal swapping.","heading":"Swapper UI/UX","subtext":"Working with the XOTC team was a fantastic experience. The transformation from their original setup to what they have now is truly remarkable."},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[9,10]}],"draft":false,"heroFeatured":false,"heroOrder":0,"searchTags":null},{"id":17,"slug":"solana-saga","title":"Solana Saga","label":"Web3 Mobile Device","description":"Marketing site, onboarding screens, custom icons, illustrations, 3D device renders, and website for Solana's flagship Web3 smartphone—the device that brought crypto to your pocket.","heroImage":"/images/case-studies/solanasaga-1.png","visionTitle":"The Vision","visionText":"Solana Saga is a Web3-focused Android smartphone designed to onboard users into the Solana blockchain ecosystem. With hardware-backed security via Seed Vault, pre-loaded wallets, and a dedicated dApp Store, Saga made crypto as simple as a tap. We were brought on to design the marketing site, onboarding experience, custom icons, illustrations, 3D device renders, and the complete web presence.","visionSubtext":"The phone that brought Web3 to your pocket—all 20,000 units sold out, with resale prices reaching $5,000 after the BONK airdrop.","fullImage":"/images/case-studies/solanasaga-2.png","challengeTitle":"The Challenge","challengeText":"Saga needed to communicate complex blockchain technology in a way that felt simple and inviting. The marketing site had to highlight immediate value—airdrops, rewards, instant wallet setup—while the onboarding screens needed to guide complete beginners through crypto setup with zero friction. Every touchpoint had to reinforce that this wasn't just another phone—it was a gateway to Web3.","challengeImage":"/images/case-studies/solanasaga-3.png","solutionTitle":"The Solution","solutionText":"We designed a cinematic marketing experience showcasing 3D device renders, custom iconography for Solana ecosystem features, and illustrated onboarding flows that made Seed Vault security feel approachable. The website balanced premium hardware positioning with the accessibility of blockchain education, driving all 20,000 units to sell out at launch.","solutionImage":"/images/case-studies/solanasaga-4.png","stats":[{"val":"20,000","label":"Units Sold Out"},{"val":"$5,000","label":"Peak Resale Price"},{"val":"Solana","label":"Ecosystem"}],"duration":"7 months","role":"Marketing Site, Onboarding, Icons, Illustration, 3D, Web","industry":"Web3 / Consumer Hardware","timeline":null,"displayOrder":13,"featured":false,"videoUrl":null,"editorialImages":null,"editorialSections":null,"draft":false,"heroFeatured":false,"heroOrder":0,"searchTags":null},{"id":18,"slug":"merck","title":"Merck","label":"Santé et pharma","description":"Des illustrations sur mesure et un design UI/UX pour l’application Chronic Cough de Merck, un outil de santé numérique qui humanise le suivi clinique.","heroImage":"/images/case-studies/merck-1.png","visionTitle":"The Vision","visionText":"When Merck set out to develop a digital tool to empower patients with chronic cough, they turned to Unfold to bring their vision to life through clean, intuitive design and human-centered illustration. The result was Chronic Cough by Merck — a comprehensive mobile app that feels less like a clinical tool and more like a friendly companion, guiding users with clarity and care from onboarding to daily cough tracking.","visionSubtext":"Great design can humanize healthcare — by blending clean UX with thoughtful illustration, we helped Merck turn a medical need into a meaningful, personal tool for everyday life.","fullImage":"/images/case-studies/merck-3.png","challengeTitle":"The Challenge","challengeText":"Health apps often feel cold and clinical. We needed to create an experience that patients of all ages could engage with — one that softened the medical tone while maintaining trust and credibility. Every illustration had to build confidence and ease anxiety, from onboarding and privacy explanations to cough tracking and physician report generation.","challengeImage":"/images/case-studies/merck-5.png","solutionTitle":"The Solution","solutionText":"We developed a custom illustration style that balances professionalism with empathy — soft lines, gentle expressions, and subtle movement guiding users through each stage. A soothing palette of purples and blues creates calm while maintaining visual consistency. Smart cough session scheduling, real-time tracking, clear privacy controls, and downloadable physician reports bridge the gap between patients and providers.","solutionImage":"/images/case-studies/merck-2.png","stats":[{"val":"40+","label":"Custom Illustrations"},{"val":"100%","label":"Accessible Design"},{"val":"Merck","label":"Enterprise Client"}],"duration":"6 Months","role":"UI/UX Design, Illustration, Visual System","industry":"Healthcare & Pharmaceuticals","timeline":"Q2 2021 - Q1 2022","displayOrder":14,"featured":true,"videoUrl":null,"editorialImages":["/images/case-studies/merck-1.png","/images/case-studies/merck-2.png","/images/case-studies/merck-3.png","/images/case-studies/merck-4.png","/images/case-studies/merck-5.png","/images/case-studies/merck-6.png"],"editorialSections":[{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":2},{"type":"text","label":"Overview","content":"When Merck set out to build a digital tool for chronic cough patients, they needed more than clean UI — they needed warmth. We designed a comprehensive mobile app that feels less like a clinical tool and more like a friendly companion, guiding users from onboarding to daily cough tracking with clarity and care.","heading":"Humanizing Healthcare","subtext":"A bridge between patients and providers, surfacing valuable insights through data, design, and empathy."},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[3,4]},{"type":"quote","quote":"Great design can humanize healthcare. By blending clean UX with thoughtful illustration, we helped Merck turn a medical need into a meaningful, personal tool for everyday life.","attribution":"Design Philosophy"},{"type":"image-text","content":"We developed a custom illustration style that balances professionalism with empathy — soft lines, gentle expressions, and subtle movement guide users through each stage. A soothing palette of purples and blues creates calm while maintaining visual consistency with the broader UI system.","heading":"Custom Illustrations","imageIndex":1},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":5},{"type":"text","label":"Product","content":"Smart cough session scheduling, real-time tracking with visual insights, clear privacy controls with user-first permissions, and downloadable physician reports — every feature was designed to be accessible to users of all ages and technical abilities. The app transforms a functional health tool into a supportive, personal experience.","heading":"Designed for Everyone","subtext":"From onboarding to daily tracking to physician reports — every touchpoint softens the clinical feel and builds trust."}],"draft":false,"heroFeatured":false,"heroOrder":0,"searchTags":null},{"id":19,"slug":"hatch","title":"Hatch","label":"Content Marketing","description":"A fun, playful brand identity for Hatch — a content marketing subscription service producing video series, podcasts, and short-form content for B2B teams.","heroImage":"/images/case-studies/hatch-1.png","visionTitle":"The Vision","visionText":"Hatch is a content marketing subscription service that produces video series, podcasts, and short-form video content for B2B marketing teams who want to run an efficient content program. Collaborating with Erik, the Founder and CEO, we produced a fun and playful brand identity designed to stand out in the saturated landscape of subscription services.","visionSubtext":"The brand needed to feel approachable yet professional — a personality-driven identity that could scale across video, podcast, and digital touchpoints.","fullImage":"/images/case-studies/hatch-3.png","challengeTitle":"The Challenge","challengeText":"The subscription services space is crowded and visually homogeneous. Hatch needed a brand identity that would immediately differentiate it — something memorable and human that could flex across formats from YouTube thumbnails to podcast covers to website hero sections, all while communicating reliability and creative expertise.","challengeImage":"/images/case-studies/hatch-4.png","solutionTitle":"The Solution","solutionText":"We built a complete brand system anchored by a speech bubble mascot whose colors, accessories, and facial expressions are easily interchanged — giving Hatch an infinitely adaptable visual identity. The system spans logo, color palette, typography, illustration framework, and a fully designed website that brings the playful brand to life across every touchpoint.","solutionImage":"/images/case-studies/hatch-5.png","stats":[{"val":"12.3%","label":"growth"},{"val":"B2B","label":"Saas focus"},{"val":"100%+","label":"Social impressions"}],"duration":"4 Months","role":"Brand Identity, Logo, Website Design","industry":"Content Marketing & SaaS","timeline":"2024","displayOrder":15,"featured":false,"videoUrl":null,"editorialImages":["/images/case-studies/hatch-1.png","/images/case-studies/hatch-2.png","/images/case-studies/hatch-3.png","/images/case-studies/hatch-4.png","/images/case-studies/hatch-5.png","/images/case-studies/hatch-6.png","/images/case-studies/hatch-7.png"],"editorialSections":[{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":4},{"type":"text","label":"Overview","content":"Hatch is a content marketing subscription service producing video series, podcasts, and short-form content for B2B marketing teams. Working closely with founder Erik, we crafted a fun, playful brand identity designed to stand out in the saturated landscape of subscription services.","heading":"Content That Connects","subtext":"A personality-driven identity that scales across video, podcast, and digital touchpoints."},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[2,3]},{"type":"quote","quote":"In a sea of identical subscription services, Hatch needed to feel unmistakably human — memorable, adaptable, and full of personality.","attribution":"Brand Direction"},{"type":"image-text","content":"We anchored the brand around a speech bubble mascot whose colors, accessories, and facial expressions are easily interchanged — giving Hatch an infinitely adaptable visual identity that works across every format and context.","heading":"The Mascot System","imageIndex":5},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":1},{"type":"text-image","content":"The complete brand system spans logo, color palette, typography, illustration framework, and a fully designed website. Every element brings the playful brand to life while maintaining the professional credibility B2B teams expect.","heading":"Website & Brand System","imageIndex":6},{"type":"text","label":"Result","content":"With the new brand system in place, Hatch launched with a visual identity that immediately differentiates it from competitors. The mascot system provides infinite creative flexibility while the cohesive design language ensures consistency across all channels and formats.","heading":"Standing Out","subtext":"See the brand in action at hatch.fm — the website we designed for their team."}],"draft":false,"heroFeatured":false,"heroOrder":0,"searchTags":null},{"id":20,"slug":"shadow","title":"Shadow","label":"Web3 Infrastructure","description":"Brand identity and product UI for Shadow by GenesysGo — a decentralized, performant object storage platform built for Web3 developers on Solana.","heroImage":"/images/case-studies/shdw-2.png","visionTitle":"The Vision","visionText":"GenesysGo is a blockchain service provider offering secure infrastructure for developers and operators. Shadow, their flagship product, is a decentralized, performant, and scalable object storage designed for Web3 builders — essentially a decentralized AWS. Unfold led the brand design team in rebranding both GenesysGo and Shadow, creating a cohesive identity system.","visionSubtext":"Think of Shadow Drive like an à la carte Dropbox — you only pay for the storage you actually use via the $SHDW token, and if you reduce your capacity, you get your money back.","fullImage":"/images/case-studies/shdw-3.png","challengeTitle":"The Challenge","challengeText":"Shadow needed to communicate complex decentralized infrastructure in a way that felt accessible to developers. The brand had to convey trustworthiness and performance while differentiating from centralized cloud competitors. As a sub-brand of GenesysGo, Shadow required its own distinct identity that still complemented the parent brand.","challengeImage":"/images/case-studies/shdw-5.png","solutionTitle":"The Solution","solutionText":"We crafted a brand identity that positions Shadow as the premium decentralized storage solution. The UI concept for Shadow Drive brought the brand to life with a clean, functional interface — files stored across a network of devices instead of centralized data centers, all powered by the Solana blockchain. The design system bridges the gap between developer tooling and consumer-grade usability.","solutionImage":"/images/case-studies/shdw-7.png","stats":[{"val":"$0.55","label":"Per GB Storage"},{"val":"Solana","label":"Blockchain"},{"val":"Web3","label":"Ecosystem"}],"duration":"5 Months","role":"Brand Identity, UI/UX Design","industry":"Web3 / Cloud Infrastructure","timeline":null,"displayOrder":16,"featured":false,"videoUrl":null,"editorialImages":null,"editorialSections":null,"draft":false,"heroFeatured":false,"heroOrder":0,"searchTags":null},{"id":21,"slug":"lmnft","title":"LMNFT","label":"NFT Platform","description":"Brand identity and product design for LMNFT (LaunchMyNFT) — the largest NFT launchpad and automated collection generator for minting and trading.","heroImage":"/images/case-studies/lmnft-1.png","visionTitle":"The Vision","visionText":"LMNFT (LaunchMyNFT) is an automated collection generator that simplifies the process of minting and trading NFT collections on secondary marketplaces. As the largest NFT launchpad, LMNFT needed a brand identity that matched its scale and ambition. Unfold was brought on to build a complete brand system and redesign the product experience.","visionSubtext":"The brand needed to feel bold and distinctive in the crowded NFT space — a visual identity that creators and collectors would immediately recognize and trust.","fullImage":"/images/case-studies/lmnft-4.png","challengeTitle":"The Challenge","challengeText":"The NFT space is saturated with generic, trend-chasing brands. LMNFT needed to stand apart with an identity that communicated reliability and innovation. The product interface had to make complex processes — collection generation, minting, trait configuration — feel intuitive for creators of all technical levels.","challengeImage":"/images/case-studies/lmnft-7.png","solutionTitle":"The Solution","solutionText":"We built a distinctive brand identity and then implemented the new aesthetic across the entire LaunchMyNFT product. The Collection Details page became a showcase of the new brand language — clean layouts, bold typography, and a cohesive visual system that transforms a technical tool into an experience creators actually enjoy using.","solutionImage":"/images/case-studies/lmnft-9.png","stats":[{"val":"#1","label":"NFT Launchpad"},{"val":"1000+","label":"Collections Launched"},{"val":"Solana","label":"Blockchain"}],"duration":"6 Months","role":"Brand Identity, Product Design, UI/UX","industry":"Web3 / NFT","timeline":null,"displayOrder":17,"featured":false,"videoUrl":null,"editorialImages":["/images/case-studies/lmnft-1.png","/images/case-studies/lmnft-2.png","/images/case-studies/lmnft-3.png","/images/case-studies/lmnft-4.png","/images/case-studies/lmnft-5.png","/images/case-studies/lmnft-6.png","/images/case-studies/lmnft-7.png","/images/case-studies/lmnft-8.png","/images/case-studies/lmnft-9.png","/images/case-studies/lmnft-10.png"],"editorialSections":[{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":9},{"type":"text","label":"Overview","content":"LMNFT (LaunchMyNFT) is an automated collection generator that simplifies minting and trading NFT collections on secondary marketplaces. As the largest NFT launchpad, they needed a brand identity that matched their scale. We built a complete brand system and redesigned the entire product experience.","heading":"The Largest NFT Launchpad","subtext":"From brand identity to product design — a complete transformation for the leading NFT platform."},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[1,8]},{"type":"quote","quote":"The transformation from their original setup to what they have now is truly remarkable. A bold, ownable identity in a crowded space.","attribution":"Design Team"},{"type":"image-text","content":"We created a distinctive visual identity that stands apart from generic, trend-chasing NFT brands. The system communicates reliability and innovation — bold enough to be recognizable, refined enough to earn trust from both creators and collectors.","heading":"Brand Identity","imageIndex":5},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":6},{"type":"text-image","content":"After the brand redesign, we implemented the new aesthetic across the entire LaunchMyNFT product. The Collection Details page became a showcase of the new brand language — clean layouts, bold typography, and a cohesive visual system.","heading":"Design produit","imageIndex":7},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[2,3]},{"type":"text","label":"Result","content":"With the new brand and product design in place, LMNFT solidified its position as the leading NFT launchpad. The interface transforms complex processes — collection generation, minting, trait configuration — into intuitive experiences that creators of all technical levels can navigate with confidence.","heading":"A Platform Reborn","subtext":"A technical tool transformed into an experience creators actually enjoy using."}],"draft":false,"heroFeatured":false,"heroOrder":0,"searchTags":null},{"id":22,"slug":"tavus","title":"Tavus","label":"AI Video Platform","description":"A vibrant brand identity for the AI-powered video personalization platform. Record one video, generate thousands — personalized for every viewer.","heroImage":"/images/case-studies/tavus-1.png","visionTitle":"The Vision","visionText":"Tavus is a video personalization platform that uses AI to create personalized videos for each viewer. From a single recording, Tavus generates countless AI-driven videos customized with unique voice variables for every customer. We built a brand identity that captures the magic of personal connection at machine scale.","visionSubtext":"Tavus is a Turkish word meaning 'peacock.' Much of the identity exploration pulled inspiration from the bird itself — vibrant, distinctive, and impossible to ignore.","fullImage":"/images/case-studies/tavus-2.png","challengeTitle":"Identity at Scale","challengeText":"The challenge was creating a brand that felt personal and warm while representing a platform built for massive scale. The identity needed to communicate AI sophistication without losing the human touch that makes personalized video so powerful.","challengeImage":"/images/case-studies/tavus-3.png","solutionTitle":"Peacock-Inspired Design","solutionText":"The brand color palette was directly inspired by the vibrant colors of peacock feathers — Peacock Pink, Feather Green, Mint, and Sunrise. Although the logo remained clean and minimal, the palette brings energy and warmth to every touchpoint. The final logomark combines a play button with a camera eye motif.","solutionImage":"/images/case-studies/tavus-4.png","stats":[{"val":"10x","label":"Higher Engagement"},{"val":"1M+","label":"Videos Generated"},{"val":"AI","label":"Powered Platform"}],"duration":"4 Months","role":"Brand Identity & Visual System","industry":"AI / Video Technology","timeline":"Q2 2023 — Q3 2023","displayOrder":18,"featured":false,"videoUrl":null,"editorialImages":null,"editorialSections":null,"draft":false,"heroFeatured":false,"heroOrder":0,"searchTags":null},{"id":23,"slug":"keycare","title":"Keycare Merck","label":"Santé et pharma","description":"Concevoir une application d’accompagnement bienveillante pour les patients traités avec Keytruda, afin de suivre les symptômes, organiser les soins et communiquer avec l’équipe médicale.","heroImage":"/images/case-studies/keycare-1.png","visionTitle":"The Vision","visionText":"Keytruda is one of the world's leading immunotherapy treatments for cancer. Merck needed a companion app that would support patients throughout their treatment journey — tracking symptoms, managing appointments, and providing emotional support through a warm, approachable interface.","visionSubtext":"Making cancer treatment management feel less clinical and more human.","fullImage":"/images/case-studies/keycare-2.png","challengeTitle":"Human-Centered Health","challengeText":"Healthcare apps are notoriously cold and clinical. Patients undergoing cancer treatment need empathy, not sterile interfaces. We developed a cast of 3D characters — doctors, nurses, and fellow patients — that guide users through the app with warmth and personality, making a difficult journey feel less isolating.","challengeImage":"/images/case-studies/keycare-6.png","solutionTitle":"Care in Every Pixel","solutionText":"From symptom logging with body-map visualization to treatment schedule tracking and downloadable reports for doctors, every feature was designed around real patient needs. The brand identity — built on intertwining ribbons symbolizing cancer awareness, health, journey, and companionship — carries through every touchpoint from app icon to marketing website.","solutionImage":"/images/case-studies/keycare-8.png","stats":[{"val":"#1","label":"App Store Health"},{"val":"50K+","label":"Active Patients"},{"val":"4.9","label":"App Store Rating"}],"duration":"8 Months","role":"Brand Identity, Product Design & Illustration","industry":"Santé et pharma","timeline":"Q2 2021 — Q1 2022","displayOrder":19,"featured":true,"videoUrl":null,"editorialImages":["/images/case-studies/keycare-1.png","/images/case-studies/keycare-2.png","/images/case-studies/keycare-5.png","/images/case-studies/keycare-4.png","/images/case-studies/keycare-6.png","/images/case-studies/keycare-7.png","/images/case-studies/keycare-8.png","/images/case-studies/keycare-9.png","/images/case-studies/keycare-10.png"],"editorialSections":[{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":1},{"type":"text","label":"Overview","content":"KeyCare is a companion app for patients undergoing Keytruda immunotherapy treatment by Merck. We designed the complete brand identity, product experience, and illustration system — creating a warm, human-centered tool that helps patients track symptoms, manage treatment schedules, and communicate with their care teams.","heading":"A Compassionate Companion","subtext":"Making cancer treatment management feel less clinical and more human."},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":2},{"type":"quote","quote":"Healthcare apps don't have to feel cold. When patients are at their most vulnerable, every interaction should feel like a gentle hand on the shoulder.","attribution":"Design Philosophy"},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[0,5]},{"type":"text","label":"Characters","content":"We developed a cast of 3D illustrated characters — doctors, nurses, caregivers, and patients — each designed from wireframe sketch to fully rendered 3D model. These characters guide users through the app experience, providing warmth and personality to interactions that would otherwise feel sterile and impersonal.","heading":"Character Design"},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":4},{"type":"text-image","content":"The app enables patients to log symptoms using an intuitive body-map visualization, track treatment dates and infusion schedules, set push notifications for medication reminders, and generate downloadable symptom summaries to share with their doctors — transforming fragmented treatment data into actionable insights.","heading":"Product Experience","imageIndex":6},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[7,8]},{"type":"text","label":"Result","content":"KeyCare launched as the #1 Health app on the App Store, serving over 50,000 active patients. The brand system — from the intertwining ribbon logomark symbolizing cancer awareness and companionship to the DM Sans typography and vibrant gradient palette — carries seamlessly across the mobile app, marketing website, and all patient-facing materials.","heading":"Care at Scale"},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":3}],"draft":false,"heroFeatured":false,"heroOrder":0,"searchTags":null},{"id":24,"slug":"solana-breakpoint","title":"Solana Breakpoint","label":"Design événementiel","description":"Créer l’identité visuelle et l’expérience complète de Breakpoint 2022 à Lisbonne, la conférence phare de Solana, de la signalétique aux produits dérivés et contenus numériques.","heroImage":"/images/case-studies/solana-breakpoint-1.png","visionTitle":"The Vision","visionText":"Breakpoint is Solana's annual developer conference — the biggest event in the Solana ecosystem. For 2022 in Lisbon, we were tasked with creating a visual identity that matched the energy and ambition of the fastest-growing blockchain community in the world.","visionSubtext":"Designing an event identity as fast and dynamic as the network itself.","fullImage":"/images/case-studies/solana-breakpoint-1.png","challengeTitle":"Kinetic Typography","challengeText":"The identity system centers on aggressive, dimensional typography that feels like it's breaking through the frame. We developed a color palette of Tech Blue, Cyber Green, and Punk Purple that extends Solana's brand into event territory — bold enough for massive installations, refined enough for badge lanyards.","challengeImage":"/images/case-studies/solana-breakpoint-3.png","solutionTitle":"Total Event Experience","solutionText":"Every touchpoint was designed as part of a unified system: from the 3D geometric entry installation and branded merchandise to mobile badge apps, wayfinding signage, live stream graphics, and social content templates. The result was an immersive brand world that attendees could see, touch, and carry home.","solutionImage":"/images/case-studies/solana-breakpoint-6.png","stats":[{"val":"3,000+","label":"Attendees"},{"val":"100+","label":"Speakers"},{"val":"3 Days","label":"Conference Duration"}],"duration":"6 Months","role":"Event Branding, Environmental Design & Digital","industry":"Blockchain & Web3","timeline":"Q1 2022 — Q3 2022","displayOrder":20,"featured":true,"videoUrl":null,"editorialImages":null,"editorialSections":null,"draft":false,"heroFeatured":false,"heroOrder":0,"searchTags":null},{"id":509,"slug":"zed","title":"ZED","label":"Crypto & Sports","description":"A next-gen digital horse racing platform where blockchain meets competitive sport. Brand identity, product design, and immersive web experience.","heroImage":"/images/case-studies/zed-1.png","visionTitle":"The Vision","visionText":"ZED needed a brand and product experience that could bring the thrill of horse racing into the digital age. We designed an identity system and platform that bridges the gap between competitive gaming, crypto collectibles, and live sports entertainment.","visionSubtext":"Making blockchain gaming feel like a premium sports experience, not a crypto project.","fullImage":"/images/case-studies/zed-2.png","challengeTitle":"Digital Meets Physical","challengeText":"The challenge was creating a brand that appeals to both crypto natives and traditional sports fans. The visual language needed to feel premium, fast-paced, and competitive — without alienating either audience.","challengeImage":"/images/case-studies/zed-3.png","solutionTitle":"Race-Day Experience","solutionText":"We designed an immersive racing interface that captures the adrenaline of live competition. Real-time race visualization, stable management dashboards, and marketplace experiences — all unified under a bold, kinetic brand system.","solutionImage":"/images/case-studies/zed-4.png","stats":[{"val":"300K+","label":"Digital Horses"},{"val":"$70M+","label":"Total Volume"},{"val":"150K+","label":"Registered Users"}],"duration":"3 Months","role":"Brand Identity & Product Design","industry":"Crypto & Sports","timeline":"Q1 2024 — Q3 2024","displayOrder":21,"featured":false,"videoUrl":null,"editorialImages":["/images/case-studies/zed-1.png","/images/case-studies/zed-2.png","/images/case-studies/zed-3.png","/images/case-studies/zed-4.png","/images/case-studies/zed-5.png"],"editorialSections":[{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":0},{"type":"text","label":"Overview","content":"ZED needed a brand and product experience that could bring the thrill of horse racing into the digital age. We designed an identity system and platform that bridges competitive gaming, crypto collectibles, and live sports entertainment.","heading":"Digital Horse Racing","subtext":"Making blockchain gaming feel like a premium sports experience."},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[1,2]},{"type":"quote","quote":"The racetrack is digital now. But the adrenaline is real.","attribution":"Design Philosophy"},{"type":"image-text","content":"We designed an immersive racing interface that captures the adrenaline of live competition. Real-time race visualization, stable management dashboards, and marketplace experiences — all unified under a bold, kinetic brand system.","heading":"Race-Day Experience","imageIndex":3},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":4},{"type":"text","label":"Result","content":"ZED launched with over 300K digital horses and $70M+ in total volume. The brand and product experience helped transform a crypto project into a legitimate digital sports platform with a passionate, engaged community.","heading":"On the Track"}],"draft":false,"heroFeatured":false,"heroOrder":0,"searchTags":null},{"id":10,"slug":"truth-social","title":"Truth Social","label":"Social Platform","description":"Building the digital town square for free expression. A platform designed around transparency, independence, and authentic community.","heroImage":"/images/case-studies/truth-7.png","visionTitle":"The Vision","visionText":"Truth Social needed a platform identity that embodied its core mission: unfiltered expression and community ownership. We designed an ecosystem that puts the user's voice at the center—clean, bold, and unapologetically direct.","visionSubtext":"Creating a social platform where design serves the message, not the algorithm.","fullImage":"/images/case-studies/truth-4.png","challengeTitle":"Identity vs. Noise","challengeText":"In a crowded social media landscape, standing apart requires more than features—it demands a design philosophy. We stripped away the visual noise that plagues modern platforms, creating an interface that amplifies rather than filters.","challengeImage":"/images/case-studies/truth-5.png","solutionTitle":"Clarity at Scale","solutionText":"Every design decision was filtered through a single question: does this empower the user? The result is a platform architecture that prioritizes readability, accessibility, and genuine engagement over algorithmic manipulation.","solutionImage":"/images/case-studies/truth-6.png","stats":[{"val":"10M+","label":"Active Users"},{"val":"1B+","label":"Brand Impressions"},{"val":"4.8 ★","label":"App Store Rating"}],"duration":"12+ Months","role":"Brand Identity, Platform Design, Marketing","industry":"Social Media & Technology","timeline":"Q1 2022 — Q1 2023","displayOrder":22,"featured":false,"videoUrl":null,"editorialImages":["/images/case-studies/truth-2.png","/images/case-studies/truth-4.png","/images/case-studies/truth-5.png","/images/case-studies/truth-6.png","/images/case-studies/truth-7.png","/images/case-studies/truth-8.png","/images/case-studies/truth-9.png","/images/case-studies/truth-10.png","/images/case-studies/truth-11.png","/images/case-studies/truth-12.png","/images/case-studies/truth-13.png","/images/case-studies/truth-14.png","/images/case-studies/truth-15.png"],"editorialSections":[{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":9},{"type":"text","label":"Overview","content":"Truth Social needed a platform identity that embodied its core mission: unfiltered expression and community ownership. We designed an ecosystem that puts the user's voice at the center—clean, bold, and unapologetically direct.","heading":"The Digital Town Square","subtext":"Creating a social platform where design serves the message, not the algorithm."},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[8,2]},{"type":"quote","quote":"A platform should amplify voices, not filter them. Every pixel serves that principle.","attribution":"Design Philosophy"},{"type":"image-text","content":"In a crowded social media landscape, standing apart requires more than features—it demands a design philosophy. We stripped away the visual noise that plagues modern platforms, creating an interface that amplifies rather than filters.","heading":"Identity & Voice","imageIndex":10},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":4},{"type":"text-image","content":"Every design decision was filtered through a single question: does this empower the user? The result is a platform architecture that prioritizes readability, accessibility, and genuine engagement over algorithmic manipulation.","heading":"Platform Architecture","imageIndex":5},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[1,6]},{"type":"text","label":"Impact","content":"The platform launched to millions of users with a design language that felt instantly familiar yet distinctly its own. By prioritizing clarity over complexity, we helped Truth Social establish a visual identity that resonates with its growing community.","heading":"Clarity at Scale"},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":12},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":7},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":11},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[0,3]}],"draft":false,"heroFeatured":false,"heroOrder":0,"searchTags":null},{"id":510,"slug":"legent-health","title":"Legent Health","label":"Santé","description":"Redéfinir l’identité d’un acteur moderne de la santé avec un système clair, rassurant et centré sur les patients.","heroImage":"/images/case-studies/legent.png","visionTitle":"The Vision","visionText":"Legent Health needed a brand that communicates care, expertise, and modernity. We built a comprehensive identity from logo to digital presence — ensuring every patient touchpoint reflects the quality of care they provide.","visionSubtext":"Healthcare branding that feels warm and human, not cold and clinical.","fullImage":"/images/case-studies/legent-2.png","challengeTitle":"Trust Through Design","challengeText":"Healthcare brands walk a fine line between approachability and authority. Legent needed to feel welcoming to patients while maintaining the credibility and professionalism expected from a medical provider.","challengeImage":"/images/case-studies/legent-3.png","solutionTitle":"Patient-First Experience","solutionText":"We crafted a visual system centered on clarity and warmth. Soft color palettes, clean typography, and intuitive digital interfaces create a seamless experience from first impression to ongoing care. Every design decision prioritizes the patient journey.","solutionImage":"/images/case-studies/legent-4.png","stats":[{"val":"50+","label":"Locations"},{"val":"200K+","label":"Patients Served"},{"val":"4.9 ★","label":"Patient Rating"}],"duration":"6 Months","role":"Brand Identity & Web Design","industry":"Santé","timeline":"Q3 2024 — Q1 2025","displayOrder":23,"featured":true,"videoUrl":null,"editorialImages":["/images/case-studies/legent-1.png","/images/case-studies/legent-2.png","/images/case-studies/legent-3.png","/images/case-studies/legent-4.png","/images/case-studies/legent-5.png","/images/case-studies/legent-6.png","/images/case-studies/legent.png"],"editorialSections":[{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":6},{"type":"text","label":"Overview","content":"Legent Health needed a brand that communicates care, expertise, and modernity. We built a comprehensive identity from logo to digital presence — ensuring every patient touchpoint reflects the quality of care they provide.","heading":"Healthcare, Redesigned","subtext":"Healthcare branding that feels warm and human, not cold and clinical."},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[2]},{"type":"quote","quote":"Great healthcare starts with trust. And trust starts with how you show up.","attribution":"Brand Strategy"},{"type":"image-text","content":"We crafted a visual system centered on clarity and warmth. Soft color palettes, clean typography, and intuitive digital interfaces create a seamless experience from first impression to ongoing care.","heading":"Patient-First Design","imageIndex":3},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":4},{"type":"text-image","content":"The website and digital touchpoints were designed to make healthcare accessible. Clear navigation, empathetic copy, and a booking flow that respects the patient's time and emotional state.","heading":"Digital Presence","imageIndex":5},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":0},{"type":"text","label":"Result","content":"Legent Health now serves over 200K patients across 50+ locations with a brand that feels as caring as the medical team behind it. The 4.9-star patient rating reflects a brand experience that matches the quality of care.","heading":"Care at Every Touchpoint"},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":1}],"draft":false,"heroFeatured":false,"heroOrder":0,"searchTags":null},{"id":512,"slug":"mighty","title":"Mighty","label":"SaaS & Technology","description":"Brand and product design for a next-generation browser built for speed. Redefining how power users interact with the web.","heroImage":"/images/case-studies/mighty-1.png","visionTitle":"The Vision","visionText":"Mighty set out to build the fastest browser in the world by streaming it from the cloud. We designed the brand identity and product experience to match the ambition — a browser that feels lighter, faster, and more powerful than anything else.","visionSubtext":"When the product is speed itself, the design language has to feel effortless.","fullImage":"/images/case-studies/mighty-2.png","challengeTitle":"Selling Speed","challengeText":"How do you brand something invisible? Speed is felt, not seen. The visual identity needed to communicate performance and premium quality without relying on tech clichés or speed metaphors.","challengeImage":"/images/case-studies/mighty-3.png","solutionTitle":"Minimal & Mighty","solutionText":"We stripped the brand down to essentials — clean lines, generous whitespace, and a refined type system that whispers power rather than shouting it. The product interface follows suit: minimal chrome, maximum content, zero friction.","solutionImage":"/images/case-studies/mighty-4.png","stats":[{"val":"500K+","label":"Beta Users"},{"val":"2x","label":"Faster Browsing"},{"val":"50%","label":"Less RAM Usage"}],"duration":"4 Months","role":"Brand Identity & Product Design","industry":"SaaS & Technology","timeline":"Q1 2021","displayOrder":24,"featured":false,"videoUrl":null,"editorialImages":["/images/case-studies/mighty-1.png","/images/case-studies/mighty-2.png","/images/case-studies/mighty-3.png","/images/case-studies/mighty-4.png","/images/case-studies/mighty-5.png"],"editorialSections":[{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":0},{"type":"text","label":"Overview","content":"Mighty set out to build the fastest browser by streaming it from the cloud. We designed the brand identity and product experience to match — a browser that feels lighter, faster, and more powerful than anything else.","heading":"Selling Speed","subtext":"When the product is speed itself, the design has to feel effortless."},{"type":"image-pair","imageIndices":[1,2]},{"type":"quote","quote":"Speed is felt, not seen. The brand had to communicate performance without saying a word.","attribution":"Brand Philosophy"},{"type":"image-text","content":"We stripped the brand down to essentials — clean lines, generous whitespace, and a refined type system that whispers power rather than shouting it. The product interface follows suit: minimal chrome, maximum content, zero friction.","heading":"Minimal & Mighty","imageIndex":3},{"type":"image-full","imageIndex":4},{"type":"text","label":"Result","content":"Mighty launched to over 500K beta users with 2x faster browsing speeds and 50% less RAM usage. The minimal brand identity became synonymous with the product's promise: do more with less.","heading":"Built for Speed"}],"draft":false,"heroFeatured":false,"heroOrder":0,"searchTags":null},{"id":511,"slug":"solana-grizzlython","title":"Solana Grizzlython","label":"Crypto et hackathon","description":"Une identité événementielle et une expérience numérique audacieuses pour le hackathon phare de Solana, pensées pour fédérer des milliers de développeurs.","heroImage":"/images/case-studies/solana-grizzly-3.png","visionTitle":"The Vision","visionText":"Solana's Grizzlython hackathon needed an identity as ambitious as its participants. We designed the complete event brand — from logo and visual system to the digital platform that onboarded and engaged thousands of developers worldwide.","visionSubtext":"Event branding that matc